# Isle -> The Quagmire -> Brackenwall Village -> The Den of Flame ->
# Brackenwall Village -> Wyrmbog -> Brackenwall Village.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Gahz'rilla (2770), Tiara of the Deep (2846).

